{"id":"948f8f3178040b74","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md","title":"Brownian Motion","display":"df-brownian-motion — Brownian Motion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-brownian-motion","aliases":["58-df-brownian-motion"],"display":"df-brownian-motion — Brownian Motion","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-adapted.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-brownian-motion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-brownian-motion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-brownian-motion — Brownian Motion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a8a0a7253619eec2\" href=\"?note=a8a0a7253619eec2\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6493b2eeaa7f968f\" href=\"?note=6493b2eeaa7f968f\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-adapted.md\">../batch04/58-df-adapted.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P\\in V\">\\(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a8a0a7253619eec2\" href=\"?note=a8a0a7253619eec2\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Adapted}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Adapted}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6493b2eeaa7f968f\" href=\"?note=6493b2eeaa7f968f\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-adapted.md\">../batch04/58-df-adapted.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}motion} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(B,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}motion} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(B,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Adaptedness is required for the same sample space <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> and time set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span> as the Brownian process, not for existentially chosen hidden witnesses.</li>\n<li>It is self-similar: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B_{ct})_{t \\geq 0} \\stackrel{d}{=} \\sqrt{c}(B_t)_{t \\geq 0}\">\\((B_{ct})_{t \\geq 0} \\stackrel{d}{=} \\sqrt{c}(B_t)_{t \\geq 0}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Wiener process is the canonical model for random motion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8a0a7253619eec2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-adapted.md","status":"resolved","id":"6493b2eeaa7f968f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-adapted.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8a0a7253619eec2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-adapted.md","status":"resolved","id":"6493b2eeaa7f968f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Adapted}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-adapted.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Adapted}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}motion} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(B,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\Omega)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"(B_{ct})_{t \\geq 0} \\stackrel{d}{=} \\sqrt{c}(B_t)_{t \\geq 0}","di